class_pointer_and_c_widths.jux:26:26: [E0515] error: `get` is a method of `Box`, and a class pointer reaches the object's fields, not its methods -- call it on a handle to the object instead
class_pointer_and_c_widths.jux:28:28: [E0513] error: `readWide` cannot be used as `fn(int*) -> int`: parameter `p` is a pointer to `int`, which is a different width in Jux and in C, so no Jux function can take that C pointer -- spell the pointee with a fixed width (`i32*`, `i64*`, `byte*`) in both places
